# Files Docker never copies into a build. Keeps builds fast and, more importantly, keeps secrets
# and junk out of the image.

# Secrets and local settings
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env.local

# Build output and dependencies (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
backend/target

# Version control, editors, docs, scripts, CI
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
docs
scripts
infra
**/*.log
**/*.md
